{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43054","headline":"湘江 · 黄文","name":"湘江","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"潇湘江头三月春，柳条弄日摇黄金。\n鹧鸪一声在何许，黄陵庙前烟霭深。\n丹青欲画无好手，稳提玉勒沈吟久。\n马蹄不爲行客留，心挂长林屡回首。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄文","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43054.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43054","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}